          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Side seating at a glance</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Our patient and guest seating options offer comfortable, stylish alternatives for your hospital rooms. Each chair's ergonomic design provides lumbar, leg and hip support while the highly-resilient construction complements clinical standards.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">SpareChair Flexible Seating</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Symmetry II Bariatric Chair</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Symmetry II Patient and Guest Seating</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
